# Generate by tools
.gitkeep
.keep

# ========================================
# ⚠️  CRITICAL - NEVER COMMIT THESE ⚠️
# ========================================
# - .env files with secrets
# - AWS access keys or credentials
# - Database passwords
# - API keys from third parties
# - Private SSH keys
# - node_modules/ (rebuild with npm install)
# - Build outputs (regenerate as needed)
# - Coverage reports
# - OS and IDE specific files
# - Temporary files created during development
